      'The first step is a load test on the battery and a check of the panel or AC charger. A replacement battery solves many cases. Beyond that, a Patriot II with limit switch drift is adjusted, and a Ranger 500 or Ranger HD with incorrect limit settings on its control board is reset. Gates off SH 171 or US 67 on rural tracts benefit most from a cleaned and re-aimed panel.',
