      'We diagnose in that order: gate first, then operator. Once the rollers and track are sound, a heavy slide operator’s drive and board are tested, and a T-21 swing operator gets its limits reset. Where solar charging is used on a remote gate, the battery is load tested. Entrances along SH 183 Airport Freeway and Euless Main Street are within our coverage.',
