      'For an older Elite such as the SL585 or a Miracle One whose board is no longer made, we explain whether a current part can be fitted or whether an Elite Series unit like the CSW200UL should replace the operator on the same gate. On a working operator, a capacitor and limit adjustment often restore it. Courtyard and drive gates in Lakeside and Highland Park West also get their hinges and pivots checked before anything electrical is replaced.',
