      'We test both together. A 6050 or 6300 swing operator with a worn gearbox or failed board is repaired where parts exist. A telephone entry panel such as the 1834 or 1812 that has lost its phone line can often be moved to cellular rather than replaced. Hinges and pivots are checked on the gate itself. We work along Armstrong Parkway, Preston Road and around Turtle Creek Acreage.',
