      'We test the supply and wiring first, since a voltage drop on a long run can look like an operator fault. Then the capacitor, limits and board are checked. On an SL3000UL or CSW200UL these are serviceable parts. Older Elite units with obsolete boards are assessed honestly, and an Elite Series replacement is quoted only if needed. Estates around Winningkoff and off FM 2551 are typical locations.',
